# FTP deploy is on demand

Do not upload to `nucleus.togudv.ru` after ordinary edits. Test locally (`site/index.html` or `python -m http.server 8080 --directory site`).

When the user explicitly asks to publish, deploy, or upload the timetable, follow the `deploy-timetable` skill and run `python tools/deploy.py` (preview with `--dry-run`). Never commit `.ftp.env` or print the FTP password.
